# Porto Verde

An original open-world crime game set in a sun-soaked port city. Explore Porto Verde on foot and by car, steal and drive cars, outrun the police as your wanted level climbs, take on missions for courier Luz Ferrer and fixer Rio Marín, fight back when trouble finds you, and save your progress to pick up where you left off.

Built with three.js, procedural art, and synthesised audio — no external assets.

## Features

- Open port-city map to explore on foot or behind the wheel
- Steal and drive cars around the city
- Wanted level system with police pursuit
- Story missions for Luz Ferrer and Rio Marín
- Combat, pickups, and a living city
- Save / load your progress

## Run it

```bash
node serve.ts
```

Then open http://localhost:8080 in your browser.

## Controls

- **W / A / S / D** — move / drive
- **Shift** — sprint
- **E** — enter / exit a car
- **Space** — brake / handbrake
- **Mouse** — look around
- **Left click** — attack / interact
- **Esc** — pause menu

